If the repository shows that Genesis Corpus → Repository Knowledge Seeding → Educational Corpus work has advanced beyond our previous roadmap position during M50, use the actual current implementation, not the older conversation plan, to determine what comes next.

That audit should determine the next program milestone before another source change is made.
